  "pricing.whatTitle": "What is a credit?",
  "pricing.whatCopy": "A credit is the unit Zufishan uses to describe a learning budget. One credit is one US dollar of teaching value.",
  "pricing.whatCopy2": "A credit is not an hour. How many credits a lesson uses depends on your teacher's hourly rate and how long the lesson runs, so an hour with one teacher can cost more than an hour with another.",
  "pricing.ratesTitle": "Every teacher sets their own rate",
  "pricing.ratesCopy": "Teachers publish their own hourly rate on their profile, so you can choose someone whose rate and teaching suit you.",
