  "pricing.browseTeachers": "Browse teachers",
  "pricing.faqTitle": "Common questions",
  "pricing.faq.q1": "What are credits?",
  "pricing.faq.a1": "Credits are the budget unit for tutoring on Zufishan. One credit is one US dollar of teaching value, and credits are used as you study rather than per lesson booked.",
  "pricing.faq.q2": "How is my monthly estimate calculated?",
  "pricing.faq.a2": "Your teacher's hourly rate is multiplied by the hours you want each week, then by 52 weeks divided by 12 months — about 4.33 weeks, which is what a month really holds.",
  "pricing.faq.q3": "Can I change the currency?",
  "pricing.faq.a3": "Yes. The selector converts every price on this page. Packages are priced in US dollars, and a converted figure is a guide rather than the exact amount that would be taken.",
  "pricing.faq.q4": "Can I choose a different teacher?",
  "pricing.faq.a4": "Yes. Credits are not tied to one teacher. You can study with more than one and change whenever you wish.",
  "pricing.faq.q5": "Does every teacher charge the same?",
  "pricing.faq.a5": "No. Each teacher sets their own hourly rate, which is shown on their profile and in search results.",
  "pricing.faq.q6": "What happens to credits I do not use?",
  "pricing.faq.a6": "This has not been decided yet. Zufishan will publish the rule for unused credits before payments go live, and it will be shown here and at checkout.",
  "pricing.faq.q7": "How does payment work?",
  "pricing.faq.a7": "Payments are not connected yet. Nothing on this page can be bought, and no card details are collected anywhere on Zufishan. When a provider is connected, this page will say so and every step will be shown before anything is charged.",
